# Keep the build context small and reproducible: dependencies and compiled output
# are produced inside the image, never copied from the host.
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/*.tsbuildinfo

.git
.github
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

adr
design
*.md
docker-compose*.yml

# scripts/ and infra/ are NOT excluded: the bootstrap and edge images bake those files in, which
# is what lets a deployment be one compose file with nothing mounted from the host. They are a
# few hundred kilobytes of text and configuration.
